In `decideSwap`, after the approval checks pass and the shift is reassigned, every other pending request for the same shift is now refused with the same `at`. All the throwing checks come before any change, so a failed approval alters nothing. Refusals, other shifts' requests and already-decided requests are untouched. I have not run it.
